# Compare Skill: High-Use vs Standard-Use
## Purpose
Compare downtime hours between equipment usage categories.
## When to Use
Evaluating operational usage impact on equipment performance.
## Required Inputs
equipment_data.csv with downtime_hours and usage_category.
## Files Used
data/equipment_data.csv, final_report.qmd
## Method
Welch Two Sample t-test (`t.test()`).
## Procedure
Run compare code chunk in final_report.qmd.
## Validation
Ensure two valid comparison groups with continuous metric output.
## Output
Degrees of freedom, p-value, 95% confidence interval, and group means.
## Interpretation
Determines statistical significance of breakdown severity between groups.
## Limitation
Does not control for device age or maintenance history directly.